@startuml UC-42
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-42.md
title UC-42: View Product Reviews
footer Feature REV-02 | Business rules: BR-39
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Guest / Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "ProductsController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ReviewService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open reviews of a product
MVC -> API : GET /api/products/{productId}/reviews?page={page}
API -> SVC : GetProductReviewsAsync(productId, page)
SVC -> DB : Select reviews WHERE ProductId = productId AND IsVisible = 1\nJOIN Users (FullName) ORDER BY CreatedAt DESC (paged) (BR-39)
SVC -> DB : Select AverageRating, ReviewCount of product
SVC --> API : ProductReviewsDto
API --> MVC : 200 OK
alt no visible reviews
  MVC --> U : Show "No reviews yet"
else reviews found
  MVC --> U : Show average rating, count and review list
end

@enduml
